cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the GMEOW ontology, please cite it as below."
title: "GMEOW — Global Metadata and Entity Ontology for the Web"
abstract: >-
  A reasoning-centric, OWL 2 DL, upper-ontology-grounded super-vocabulary that
  unifies document metadata, entity descriptions, legal agreements, contacts and
  person-centric data. Grounded in gUFO and aligned to FOAF, REL, DOAP, PROV-O,
  schema.org and Wikidata.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Blackcat Informatics Inc."
    website: "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-06-03"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow"
keywords:
  - ontology
  - OWL
  - linked-data
  - FAIR
  - entity
  - metadata
